# Routine "Afternoon loop check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday afternoon, what went stale since the morning brief, each item with a drafted nudge.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/mr-toms && pi -p "/afternoon-loop-check"
